# Shell runs under bash on every platform this project supports, Git Bash on
# Windows included — and Git for Windows checks text out with CRLF by default
# (core.autocrlf=true), which bash refuses: `set -euo pipefail\r` is not an
# option it knows. Keep every script LF in the working tree, whatever the
# platform's setting. The hook has no extension, so it is named.
*.sh                 text eol=lf
.githooks/pre-commit text eol=lf
